    "orvaine_3": {
      "type": "interactive-content-helper-tabs-accordion",
      "settings": {
        "show_header": true,
        "heading": "Answers by topic.",
        "subheading": "",
        "layout_mode": "tabs_horizontal",
        "style_preset": "faq",
        "accordion_default_open": "all_closed",
        "use_custom_colors": true,
        "bg": "#EEE8DF",
        "text": "#24211F",
        "muted": "#5E544B",
        "accent": "#69343B",
        "border": "#E2DBD0"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "or_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Specifications",
            "anchor_id": "specifications",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>What does \"proposed\" mean?</h3><p>It means a design intention for a fictional product. Dimensions, materials, closures and hardware are labeled \"Proposed materials and construction for this fictional design.\"</p><h3>Is the material genuine leather?</h3><p>No material is verified. Listings describe a leather-like appearance and note that fiber, hide, alloy and supplier composition are unverified.</p>"
          }
        },
        "or_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Care",
            "anchor_id": "care",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>How do I clean my bag?</h3><p>Care guidance will be confirmed against the final material specification. Do not treat this concept listing as a cleaning instruction.</p><h3>Is it waterproof?</h3><p>No water resistance or durability claim is made for any design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "or_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Colors",
            "anchor_id": "colors",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>Why does the second color show the same photograph?</h3><p>Each design is photographed in its primary color only. A second color is a proposed specification without a photograph, and is never recolored from another image.</p><h3>Is the swatch exact?</h3><p>Swatches are flat digital colors, not a promise of a finished material.</p>"
          }
        },
        "or_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Ordering",
            "anchor_id": "ordering",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>Can I buy a design?</h3><p>Not yet. ORVAINE is a fictional concept store. You can add a design to the bag to see how ordering would work, but checkout is disabled and nothing is charged.</p><h3>Do you ship or take returns?</h3><p>No shipping, returns or warranty terms are offered. A real store would publish them here.</p>"
          }
        },
        "or_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Imagery",
            "anchor_id": "imagery",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<h3>Are these real photographs?</h3><p>Generated concept imagery; appearance and scale are illustrative.</p><h3>Why do some views look alike?</h3><p>Plain symmetrical designs can have similar alternate studio views. Each view is labeled by what it shows.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "or_1",
        "or_2",
        "or_3",
        "or_4",
        "or_5"
      ]
